**14.2. Recurrence Relations**

**14.2.1**: \(L\,\frac{du_{L}}{d\rho}\!\!=\!\!(L^{2}\!\!+\!\!\eta^{\circ})u_{L-1}\!\!-\!\!( \frac{L^{2}}{\rho}\!\!+\!\!\eta)u_{L}\]
