**14.2.3**: \(L\!(L\!+\!1)^{2}\!\!+\!\!\eta^{2}]u_{L+1}\!\!=\!(2L\!+\!1)[\eta\!\!+\!\!\frac{L (L\!+\!1)}{\rho}]u_{L}\)

